  "body": "Independent post-promotion readiness re-grant by QA Lead (AID-412).\n\n- Executable scenarios re-run at pin 72130c6d in a QA-owned worktree: pilot suite 4/4, chapter-continuity + renderer-fallback + readiness-recovery 5/5 (one retry after a documented spec race in completePipeline — see AID-412 report).\n- Independent live observations on BOTH production bindings (alias + permalink 6a946c865e010af1557561de): 51/51 remote matrix checks per binding.\n- Assessment v14: os-returning-learner PASS, os-voxel-guided-missions PASS, os-literacy-guided-mission conditional-follow-up (production bridge verifier scope gap, dispositioned) — all customer-ready.\n- Canonical matrix regenerated: results.ndjson append-only, README re-rendered; cli check in sync.\n\nLanding note: board-only merge per house rules (FPE executes the merge window after review).",
